              "marks": [
                "n5jk5z7p1fye"
              ],
              "text": "Baris"
            },
            {
              "_key": "iallcrn5s75f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Travel Routes & Transportation Options"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "n5jk5z7p1fye",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58774",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Baris Oasis, a tranquil hideaway nestled in Egypt’s "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Western Desert"
            },
            {
              "_key": "4ncsioad88hy",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", is often a highlight of desert safari excursions, particularly due to its strategic location just 90 kilometers away from Al "
            },
            {
              "_key": "vahukjd6b3sr",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "10iadpoyjzb3"
              ],
              "text": "Kharga Oasis"
            },
            {
              "_key": "lemet8go7k35",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". For adventurers and tranquility seekers alike, reaching this serene oasis is a journey that combines both adventure and peace."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Western_Desert_(Egypt)",
              "newTab": true
            },
            {
              "_key": "10iadpoyjzb3",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58873",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The recommended and safest mode of transport to Baris Oasis is via a four-wheel-drive vehicle. Renting a 4WD not only assures a secure passage through the challenging desert landscapes but also provides the freedom to "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000008"
              ],
              "text": "explore"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " these captivating environments at one’s leisure. This option suits those who prefer a more independent and flexible travel experience."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/nuweiba-travel-guide/exploring/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/nuweiba-travel-guide/exploring/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Alternatively, joining an organized "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "tour"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " to Baris Oasis can be an enriching choice. Such tours come with the expertise of knowledgeable guides who offer deep insights into the historical and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "cultural"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " context of Baris. Besides the educational aspect, these tours offer the comfort of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "traveling in a group"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", which can be reassuring for many, especially in the unpredictable desert terrain."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/akhmim-travel-guide/tours/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/akhmim/tours-in-akhmim",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/animals-in-ancient-egypt/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/animales-en-el-antiguo-egipto",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/egypt-package-deals/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/ejiputo-ryoko-pakkeji-no-erabikata",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Regardless of the chosen means of transport, a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "visit to Baris Oasis"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is more than just a destination; it’s an experience. It offers a unique blend of serenity and excitement, allowing visitors to immerse themselves in the untouched beauty of one of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001b"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " lesser-known retreats. Whether you are seeking a peaceful escape or an adventurous exploration, Baris Oasis provides an unforgettable journey through the heart of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s Western Desert"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
